<title>USA: U.S. House panel to hold hearing on WTO meeting.</title>
<headline>U.S. House panel to hold hearing on WTO meeting.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. House Ways and Means subcommittee on trade said Friday it will hold a hearing on February 26 on the outcome of the World Trade Organization ministerial meeting held in Singapore in December.</p>
<p>The hearing will examine the outcome of the meeting, the Information Technology Agreement, implementation of the Uruguay Round Agreements, and the prospects for the future of the WTO, a statement said.</p>
</text>
